{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp Sales：名單合併按鈕",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-sales-merge-btn) 在 Corp 銷售名單頁面偵測到重複名單時，於畫面頂部顯示一鍵合併按鈕，自動依序完成所有合併作業",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "world": "MAIN"
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}
